<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to attend Thursday parliament meeting.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to attend Thursday parliament meeting.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend a parliamentary committee meeting on Thursday from 10.33 a.m. (0133 GMT) to 10.50 a.m. (0150 GMT) to answer questions from a member of the Lower House, the BOJ said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
